WEBVTT

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.893
and contrary to the name,

00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:32.976
they couldn't get a good night's rest

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.851
due to the constant blasting
and drilling that was necessary

00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:39.351
to build the cross-Bronx expressway

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:41.101
a block away.

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:44.309
I consider these policy decisions

00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:46.268
design crimes.

00:01:46.292 --> 00:01:50.042
(Applause)

00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:53.643
Being the resilient people
that we are uptown,

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:56.559
out of the systematic oppression

00:01:56.583 --> 00:02:02.518
hip-hop culture rose from the rubble
and the ashes like a phoenix.